{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714190/extras/NG_anim_intro.gif?t=1749489584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714190/extras/NG_Titres_ENG_02.gif?t=1749489584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the acclaimed team behind <i>Blasphemous</i>, <i>NINJA GAIDEN: Ragebound</i> successfully unites the classic lore and gameplay of the Tecmo-developed (now KOEI TECMO GAMES) <i>NINJA GAIDEN</i> series from the classic era with the depth and intensity of the modern 3D entries. The best of both eras come together to create an epic and thrilling adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714190/extras/Ninja_Gaiden_Omusubi_GamePlay_GIF_1.gif?t=1749489584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here\u2019s a glimpse of what awaits you in the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dojo Tutorial</strong>: Learn the basics alongside the legendary Ryu Hayabusa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hayabusa Village</strong>: Defend the village in a full level, culminating in an intense boss fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Entwined Fates</strong>: Familiarize yourself with Kumori\u2019s unique actions in a dedicated tutorial level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Odawara Castle</strong>: Time to venture deep into the fortress\u2026 However, you\u2019ll have to wait to experience the full boss fight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hard Mode</strong>: Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to become a true Ninja master? Test your strength and skills with <i>NINJA GAIDEN: Ragebound</i>\u2019s brutal difficulty: revisit Hayabusa Village in a punishing Hard Mode version once you've cleared the level the first time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714190/extras/Ninja_Gaiden_Omusubi_GamePlay_GIF_5.gif?t=1749489584\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714190?t=1749489584","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714190/9a1dda0460c9d265c4eee8c5cecc2e9a2dcaa2cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749489584","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714190/f3ea00793bea7b34b72ccd80b033547e22fd186c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749489584","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714190/f3ea00793bea7b34b72ccd80b033547e22fd186c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749489584","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714190/extras/NG_anim_intro.gif?t=1749489584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714190/extras/NG_Titres_ENG_02.gif?t=1749489584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the acclaimed team behind <i>Blasphemous</i>, <i>NINJA GAIDEN: Ragebound</i> successfully unites the classic lore and gameplay of the Tecmo-developed (now KOEI TECMO GAMES) <i>NINJA GAIDEN</i> series from the classic era with the depth and intensity of the modern 3D entries. The best of both eras come together to create an epic and thrilling adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714190/extras/Ninja_Gaiden_Omusubi_GamePlay_GIF_1.gif?t=1749489584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here\u2019s a glimpse of what awaits you in the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dojo Tutorial</strong>: Learn the basics alongside the legendary Ryu Hayabusa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hayabusa Village</strong>: Defend the village in a full level, culminating in an intense boss fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Entwined Fates</strong>: Familiarize yourself with Kumori\u2019s unique actions in a dedicated tutorial level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Odawara Castle</strong>: Time to venture deep into the fortress\u2026 However, you\u2019ll have to wait to experience the full boss fight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hard Mode</strong>: Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to become a true Ninja master? Test your strength and skills with <i>NINJA GAIDEN: Ragebound</i>\u2019s brutal difficulty: revisit Hayabusa Village in a punishing Hard Mode version once you've cleared the level the first time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714190/extras/Ninja_Gaiden_Omusubi_GamePlay_GIF_5.gif?t=1749489584\" /></p>","developers":["The Game Kitchen"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2542120","name":"NINJA GAIDEN: Ragebound"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714190/ceedbee72ac420cfff95dca68f73d6387bb2e433/head